    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Cross-cutting contract enforcement + reconciliation across the outputs of five parallel tasks (six renderers, two barrels): high blast radius, and the judgment of whether a divergence is a renderer bug to fix or a contract question to escalate is exactly the boundary Step 3.5.5b routes to opus.</model-tier-reason>
