  <notes>
    Spec refs: FR-10 (this task IS its acceptance), FR-11, D-10, NFR-08; plan.md Strategy point 3 and
    Parallel Groups table ("None may edit fields/index.ts — that is task 015"). The suite is deliberately
    behavior-parameterized rather than lowest-common-denominator: identical SEMANTICS, per-renderer
    GESTURES. Keep adapters small — if an adapter needs more than props factory + gestures + expected
    payload, the renderer probably deviates and that is a finding, not an adapter feature. Top-level
